==[[Range/Lore|The Range's lore assets]]==
===[[Range/Lore/V25|Season 2025]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone109.mp3}} "Gonna be quick, Brim. Getting word of Kingdom sites getting hit all over the world in the last month with the same radianite fuel getting stolen. I got my hands on some 'kay footage and, yeah, the crew working the gig are in the same getup as the guys we fought in Thailand! Long story short, whatever they're doing, we didn't stop them. Let me know if you need me to take a crew off base to do some digging."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone110.mp3}} "No, you still gotta cover her, Phoenix! Go run it again! Hey Brim, just... just wrapping up training now. Well, T was right. You've got a whole bunch of talented folks here who can move and shoot like pros. Great on their own!... but rusty as anything as a unit, heh. But that's where I come in, right? Yeah, okay. Just give me the time you promised and I'll get you a team ready for war."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone114.mp3}} "Hey, it's me. Just wrapped up the last training session and... yeah, we're looking good! All the big stuff, comms, interplay, trust, they're doing great. Really. Funny to think about how things were looking a few months ago, huh? Bunch of kids running around trying to steal the spotlight from each other. And me, mooching around trying to find a place to call home. Anyways... they're ready now, Brim. Just give them a push. They'll fly."

